     "text": "Giants QB J.J. McCarthy threw for 243 yards in the 4th quarter despite coming off the bench. It\u2019s the most passing yards in a 4th quarter by any player this season and the 2nd-most passing yards in a 4th quarter by any QB who didn't start over the last 25 seasons."
